/Title (This business intelligence report synthesizes core commercial performance indicators, revenue concentrations, channel contributions, and profitability drivers from the Power BI Dataset 5 dashboard. Covering transactional activity from 12-01-2024 to 11-01-2026, the platform integrates multi-store retail operations across seven product categories, tracking gross revenue, operational costs, net profit margins, and order volume across physical and digital storefronts.)
