/Title (Conclusion: The Power BI Dataset 5 dashboard provides clear executive visibility into a 4.71bn retail operation generating 979.89M in net profit across 15K transactions. Commercial performance is anchored by consumer electronics \(Mobile Phones, Laptops, Televisions\) and physical Urban, Flagship, and Mall storefronts in Tier-1 Indian metros. Resolving minor text-casing inconsistencies in the data model and implementing targeted Q1 and cross-category merchandising strategies will strengthen both reporting precision and net margin resilience)
